<title>UK: Commerzbank adds 50 million rand to two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank adds 50 million rand to two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 150 million rand from 100 million rand, lead manager Hambros said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN	 COUPON     15.25     MATURITY    16.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE**100.925   PAY DATE  L 15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LUX	 L- LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES    *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MILLION RAND ON 18.MAR.97</p>
<p>	   **NEW ISSUE PRICE.</p>
<p>	     ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
